  "description": "With its newly re-designed frame, the PD 4 features a low stand-over height for easier climbing in & out of the saddle. Its lightweight aluminum frame features a tapered head tube, internal cable routing and an improved kickstand position. It comes standard with an easy-to-use 1x11 Shimano XT/SLX drive train, versatile and capable of handling a wide variety of terrain. It rolls along on strong double-wall rims, stainless spokes and Kenda Kwick Seven.5 tires with reflective sidewalls for increased safety. The PD4 features a Rockshox Judy Silver Boost / 100mm travel fork with a remote hydraulic lockout at the handlebar, which deactivates the up and down motion associated with suspension. For easier maintenance overtime, the PD4 features quality Shimano mechanical disc brakes and levers. The PD4 is your trusted partner for community and outreach patrols.\nHaro PD4 27.5\" X6 frame, updated kickstand position\nRockshox Judy Silver, 27.5\" Boost fork, 100mm, remote Lockout\nFSA Comet Modular 34T crankset\nXT 11-spd Shadow rear derailleur\nSLX M7000 11-spd shifter & 11-46T cassette\nWTB Comfort Sport saddle\nMX-21 27.5\" Aluminum DW rims\nAlivio / Altus, Front T/A, 36H hubs\nShimano Mechanical BR-M375 disc brakes\nShimano Deore BL-T4000 brake levers",
